            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "It requires real precautions. Xylene vapour is harmful to breathe, heavier than air so it pools in low areas, and flammable, so proper respiratory protection is needed rather than a dust mask. On an enclosed patio, a balcony or anywhere fumes drift into the house, water-based is the sensible choice."
          }
        }
      ],
    },
    {
      "@type": "Article",
      headline: title,
      description: description,
      author: authorSchema(),
      datePublished: dates.published,
      dateModified: dates.modified,
      publisher: { "@type": "Organization", name: "The Honest Reviewers" },
    },
  ],
};
